  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1740777567_7784384_a4771b9aaab2946ea40774b23fd8880c.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos; margin-left: 0.5in;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">At <strong>Planet 13 Lifestyles,</strong>&nbsp;we believe in living boldly. Our apparel and accessories are made for those who seek more than just fashion &ndash; they strive to make a statement. From our unique essentials to our limited-edition collections &amp; collabs, we are here to help you express your individual style and live life to the fullest.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos; margin-left: 0.5in;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(33, 33, 33); color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: Aptos; margin-left: 0.5in;\">\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0in; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: black;\">Our products are thoughtfully designed for the movers, the dreamers, and the creators and are carefully crafted with quality materials, ensuring both durability and a luxurious feel.&nbsp; Whether you&rsquo;re headed for a night on the town, a day full of activity, or a laid-back brunch with friends, Planet 13 Lifestyles offers fits that match your energy and ambition.<br><br>Explore our exclusive collection today and discover a look as iconic as the Planet 13 experience itself!</span></p>\r\n</div>",
